 🎓 Career Path Recommendation & E-Learning Management System

 📌 Overview

Career Path Recommendation & E-Learning Management System is a Django-based web application that helps students and job seekers discover suitable career paths using Machine Learning. The platform integrates career prediction, online learning, job recruitment, quizzes, tutor interaction, and company hiring into a single system.

The system uses NLP and Machine Learning techniques to analyze user interests, skills, hobbies, and educational background to recommend the most suitable career options.

---

 🚀 Problem Statement

Students often face difficulties in:

* Choosing the right career path
* Finding proper learning resources
* Connecting with tutors and companies
* Accessing personalized career guidance

Traditional career guidance systems are mostly generic and do not consider individual interests and skill sets.

This project solves these problems by:

* Providing AI-based career recommendations
* Integrating courses and recruitment in one platform
* Offering communication between students, tutors, and companies
* Creating a centralized career development ecosystem

---

 🧠 Machine Learning Implementation

 ML Model Used

* Random Forest Classifier

 NLP Techniques Used

* TF-IDF Vectorization
* Text preprocessing and feature combination

 Input Features

The model predicts careers based on:

* Educational Stream
* Favorite Subject
* Technical Skills
* Soft Skills
* Languages Known
* Interests
* Hobbies

 Target Prediction

* Career Recommendation

Examples:

* Data Scientist
* Software Engineer
* UI/UX Designer
* Teacher
* Cyber Security Analyst

---

 📊 Dataset Used

 Dataset

* Indian Career Dataset (100K Records)

 Dataset File

bash
