---

 ⚙️ Machine Learning Workflow

 Step 1: Data Collection

User enters:

* Skills
* Interests
* Subjects
* Hobbies
* Languages

 Step 2: Text Combination

All text features are combined into a single input.

 Step 3: Feature Extraction

TF-IDF Vectorization converts text into numerical vectors.

 Step 4: Model Training

Random Forest model is trained using dataset.

 Step 5: Career Prediction

Model predicts the most suitable career.

---

 📊 Results & Accuracy

 Training Method

* 80-20 Train-Test Split

 Approximate Accuracy

* 85% – 92%

 Evaluation Metrics

* Accuracy Score
* Precision
* Recall
* F1-Score
* Classification Report

